        "question": "下面 schedule 函数（活动选择）的时间复杂度为（　）。\nint schedule(int n, activity * p) {\n    sort(p, p + n, compare);\n    int cnt = 0, end = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)\n        if (p[i].start >= end) { end = p[i].end; cnt++; }\n    return cnt;\n}",
