        "question": "下面 count_triple 函数的时间复杂度为（　）。\nint count_triple(int n) {\n    int cnt = 0;\n    for (int a = 1; a <= n; a++)\n        for (int b = a; a + b <= n; b++)\n            for (int c = b; a + b + c <= n; c++)\n                if (a * a + b * b == c * c) cnt++;\n    return cnt;\n}",
